# 44f88974 was not merged yet) and before maddi a51782475 (`!!` on a nullable for-each iterable): 761 type errors,
# 275 of them null into a non-null declaration (locals, array elements, type arguments). With local verdicts the
# numbers move: tighten them in the commit after the merge.
